00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Imagine a world where some countries were mean and hurt others. Germany, Italy, and Japan were among these countries. They started a war called World War 2. But, a group of good countries like the USA, UK, and the Soviet Union joined forces and said, 'Enough is enough!' They worked together to stop the war and bring peace. That's the amazing story of how World War 2 ended.
